Hi Vlad,

The data sound to be acceptable, but the results with all points sounds unusual and with an error model it's unlikely that the DOF comes out to be an integer even with only good points.
Are the Argos error ellipses being imported by as.telemetry()? This should happen if the data are in Movebank format. When you run head() on an individual telemetry object, you should see error ellipse columns: COV.x.x, COV.x.y, COV.y.y
Are you turning on the error model in the guess object, like in the vignette?
Best,
Chris

