Hi Cindy,

The variograms appear fairly stable, but just very noisy. You might consider fixing the dt argument and then combining them all with mean() to get a cleaner population variogram.

Make sure to use weights=TRUE when you run akde() to account for the irregular sampling.

Best,
Chrsi

